 "notes": [
  "TOU periods per 甘发改价格〔2024〕424号 as restated in note 3 (2026-01..07) / note 2 (2026-08..10) of every monthly notice: 高峰 6:00-8:00、18:00-23:00; 平 23:00-6:00(次日)、8:00-10:00、16:00-18:00; 低谷 10:00-16:00 (all months; no 尖峰/深谷).",
  "Market-based TOU: the 峰/谷 spread of the 上网电价 (代理购电价格) is formed by the market (甘肃中长期/现货交易规则), 上网环节线损电价 floats with it; 输配电价, 系统运行费, 基金 do not float.  The table therefore prints 代理购电价格 and 线损 per period and no 非分时 price: energy_price = 平时段 分时电度电价, purchase_price / line_loss = 平时段 values; 高峰/低谷 period prices in announcements.json.",
  "2025-11 and 2025-12: no 代理购电 announcement in the 95598.cn 甘肃 listing (series starts 2026-01) and no other official free copy found → missing.",
  "4th TDP period from 2026-08 (发改价格〔2026〕1077号): 单一制 adds 110 / 220千伏及以上, TDP changes.",
  "Source: 95598.cn omg-static copies; images OCR'd (tesseract) and accepted only when every row satisfies 10=1+4+7+8+9, 11=2+5+7+8+9, 12=3+6+7+8+9 exactly and 电度输配电价 equals the period's regulated value row for row.",
  "TOU policy 甘发改价格〔2024〕424号: signed 2024-07-05, effective 2024-08-01 (OCR of the official scan on 95598.cn); 2. 时段划分 is one all-year schedule; 峰谷价差 ≥ 3:1, float ratios from 2025 set separately (market-formed, see above)."
 ],
